# --- Local JourneyMap snapshot (large, personal) ---
journeymap-surface/

# --- Game data (committed so Render/host can serve a playable app) ---
# These are produced by tools/ but are small after compression, so we ship them.
# NOTE: manifest.json holds the true answer coordinates. server.js loads it from
# disk and explicitly blocks it from being served, so committing it is safe as
# long as you deploy the SERVER (Render), not a static host. Do NOT expose it on
# GitHub Pages / Netlify / any static host.

# --- Local / personal (never publish) ---
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/projects/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
